{"id":"wb-6-483","name":"平遥城隍庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"平遥城隍庙","text":"平遥城隍庙位于中华人民共和国山西省晋中市平遥县城隍庙街51号，第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n平遥城隍庙布局奇特，除中轴线外，东西两侧配置有灶君庙和财神庙，东西配殿为六曹府、土地祠，“诸神共居一庙，联袂同受香火”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%B3%E9%81%A5%E5%9F%8E%E9%9A%8D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94735753,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94735753","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b1fea2a0ba30a42a420cd2f5.jpg","title":"20250606_Pingyao_Chenghuang_Miao.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250606_Pingyao_Chenghuang_Miao.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/20250606_Pingyao_Chenghuang_Miao.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Pingyao Cheng Huang Temple","width":320,"height":240}}